{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02IM:statement", "parent_tag": "01P1", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Examples of Noetherian Jacobson schemes.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0001> is a Noetherian local ring, then\nthe punctured spectrum <MATH_0002>\nis a Jacobson scheme.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0003> is a Noetherian ring with Jacobson radical <MATH_0004>\nthen <MATH_0005> is a Jacobson scheme.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0006> is a Zariski pair (More on Algebra, Definition\n<REF_0001>)\nwith <MATH_0007> Noetherian, then <MATH_0008> is a\nJacobson scheme.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0001": "$(R, \\mathfrak m)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Spec(R) \\setminus \\{\\mathfrak m\\}$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$\\text{rad}(R)$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Spec(R) \\setminus V(\\text{rad}(R))$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "MATH_0006": "$(R, I)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{more-algebra-definition-zariski-pair}", "MATH_0007": "$R$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Spec(R) \\setminus V(I)$", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-complement-closed-point-Jacobson}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:50da7c385fc03815d3f4362aa54df427fc2be8f900f22af12015f5f13744c6e2", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2d75aaa9d4669f0addfc11ceb90bcda76bf5ec70a2dc0a4ce8a4e27e6877bd00", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b3dff21ef06fded791b5a00d9573904e290913d89f43f8268756eaa94e0b46d6"}
